# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# This file is served from dist/ (Vite copies public/ verbatim into the output
# dir) and Cloudflare Pages reads _redirects from the output directory.
#
# Why this is required: React Router owns client-side routing, but Cloudflare's
# edge only serves files that physically exist in the output dir. Without this
# rule there is no /pricing or /marketplace file, so a hard refresh, a shared
# link, or a back/forward navigation on any non-root route returns 404.
